---
import "~/assets/style/selection.scss";

import Layout from "~/layouts/Layout.astro";
import HomeCard from "~/components/HomeCard.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <main class="py-8 mx-auto w-main">
    <div class="grid grid-flow-row-dense grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <HomeCard classNames={{ container: "bg-gradient-to-r from-theme-red-light to-[#00b395] col-span-2" }}>
        <h2 class="relative z-10 mb-12 text-3xl">
          <span class="px-1 rounded-lg bg-theme-red selection-prefix">React</span>
          <br />
          <span class="px-1 rounded-lg bg-theme-red selection-suffix">从入门到放弃</span>
        </h2>
        <p>The library for web and native user interfaces.</p>
        <br />
        <p>React is an essential part of my frontend development toolkit. It’s simple and flexible, yet capable of solving complex UI challenges. </p>
      </HomeCard>

      <HomeCard classNames={{ container: 'bg-theme-yellow-light row-span-2' }}>
        <p class="mt-4 mb-16">JavaScript 是一种用于网页开发的编程语言，能够使网页实现动态交互和复杂功能。它广泛用于前端开发，也可以在服务器端运行。</p>
        <div class="relative z-10 mb-4">
          <h2 class="mb-8 text-3xl">
            <span class="px-1 rounded-lg bg-theme-yellow selection-prefix">JavaScript 基础篇</span>
          </h2>

          <h4 class="inline-block px-1 mb-4 font-bold rounded-lg bg-theme-yellow">Atwood's Law</h4>
          <br />
          <span class="px-1 rounded-lg bg-theme-yellow">Any application that can be written in JavaScript, will eventually be written in JavaScript.</span>
          <span class="selection-suffix"></span>
        </div>
      </HomeCard>

      <HomeCard classNames={{ container: 'bg-theme-blue-light' }}>
        <p class="mt-4 mb-16">JavaScript 是一种用于网页开发的编程语言，能够使网页实现动态交互和复杂功能。它广泛用于前端开发，也可以在服务器端运行。</p>
        <div class="relative z-10 mb-4">
          <h2 class="mb-8 text-3xl">
            <span class="px-1 rounded-lg bg-theme-yellow selection-prefix">JavaScript 基础篇</span>
          </h2>

          <h4 class="inline-block px-1 mb-4 font-bold rounded-lg bg-theme-yellow">Atwood's Law</h4>
          <br />
          <span class="px-1 rounded-lg bg-theme-yellow">Any application that can be written in JavaScript, will eventually be written in JavaScript.</span>
          <span class="selection-suffix"></span>
        </div>
      </HomeCard>

      <HomeCard classNames={{ container: 'bg-theme-green-light' }}>
        <p class="mt-4 mb-16">JavaScript 是一种用于网页开发的编程语言，能够使网页实现动态交互和复杂功能。它广泛用于前端开发，也可以在服务器端运行。</p>
        <div class="relative z-10 mb-4">
          <h2 class="mb-8 text-3xl">
            <span class="px-1 rounded-lg bg-theme-yellow selection-prefix">JavaScript 基础篇</span>
          </h2>

          <h4 class="inline-block px-1 mb-4 font-bold rounded-lg bg-theme-yellow">Atwood's Law</h4>
          <br />
          <span class="px-1 rounded-lg bg-theme-yellow">Any application that can be written in JavaScript, will eventually be written in JavaScript.</span>
          <span class="selection-suffix"></span>
        </div>
      </HomeCard>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
